[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-matthew-okpebholo-foundation-scholarship-2026-how-to-apply-264":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},264,"matthew-okpebholo-foundation-scholarship-2026-how-to-apply-264","Matthew Okpebholo Foundation Scholarship 2026: How To Apply","\u003Cp>The Matthew Okpebholo Scholarship offers a cash sum of ₦100,000 to each of the 1000 selected candidate of Edo State origin enrolled in tertiary higher institutions in Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Matthew Okpebholo Foundation Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Matthew Okpebholo Foundation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: ₦1,000,000 Grant\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 5, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Matthew Okpebholo Foundation Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Matthew Okpebholo Foundation Scholarship offers a cash sum of ₦100,000 to each of the 1000 selected candidate of Edo State origin enrolled in tertiary higher institutions in Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Matthew Okpebholo Scholarship 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate Matthew Okpebholo Foundation Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must be an indigent student of Edo State origin\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must be in final year of a Nigerian University or Polytechnic\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must have an officially approved final year project topic\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must complete the online application form before June 5, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must take the compulsory online Scholastic Aptitude Test\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The award is non-political and non-religious\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Matthew Okpebholo Foundation Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Matthew Okpebholo Foundation Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 5th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.matthewokpebholofoundation.org\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.matthewokpebholofoundation.org\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-27 13:25:03",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmatthew-okpebholo-foundation-scholarship-2026-how-to-apply\u002F6a16e29f3c83b9.86071467_screenshot 2026-05-27 131612.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002F